WEBVTT

01:07:29.084 --> 01:07:32.868
If you like this show, please share it
with someone else who is curious

01:07:32.892 --> 01:07:35.785
and consider rating
and reviewing us on iTunes

01:07:35.809 --> 01:07:38.136
or wherever you listen to your podcasts.

01:07:38.160 --> 01:07:40.704
I’m Chris Anderson.
Thanks so much for listening.

01:07:40.728 --> 01:07:42.657
(Music)

01:07:49.743 --> 01:07:50.910
On the next episode:

01:07:50.934 --> 01:07:55.312
leading AI researcher,
investor, author, Kai-Fu Lee.

01:07:55.336 --> 01:07:58.899
We talk about some of the amazing
developments happening in China

01:07:58.923 --> 01:08:03.666
and the possible implications
for the future of work for all of us.